PTX mbarrier-expect-tx-blocks
"As MP+mbarrier-expect-complete-tx without the complete_tx: the tx-count stays at 1 and the phase never completes. Expected: forbidden."
{
b=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
P1:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                   | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                       ;
 mbarrier.arrive.expect_tx.release.cta b, 1 | mbarrier.test_wait.parity.acquire.cta r0, b, 0 ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1)
